  "$id": "https://github.com/gordcurrie/waypoint/sync/schemas/hrv.schema.json",
  "title": "HRV data (get_hrv_data)",
  "description": "Returned by garminconnect's get_hrv_data(date). sync_hrv normalizes: raw can be a list or dict at the top level (`item = raw[0] if isinstance(raw, list) else raw`); the fields actually read live under `hrvSummary` OR flat on `item` (`summary = item.get('hrvSummary') or item`) \u2014 this fixture shows the hrvSummary-nested shape live for this account.\n\nVerified against: 2026-07-28 (status UNBALANCED), 2026-07-15 (status BALANCED) \u2014 both dict-shaped (not list), both hrvSummary-nested. Additional fields beyond what's listed here may exist and are tolerated (additionalProperties: true) \u2014 Garmin adding new fields is not a breaking change; a listed field disappearing or changing type is."
}